    "title": "This whole video",
    "topic": "Create a high-energy, 30-second vertical (9:16) product promo video for **ZoEdit Studio**—with a bold meta hook revealing that this entire video was generated inside ZoEdit Studio itself from a single prompt.\n\nVisual direction & pacing across 5 tight scenes (30s total):\n- **Scene 1 (0–5s | The Meta Hook):** Dark sleek tech background with glowing cyan/electric-blue accents. Kinetic bold typography slams in: \"This entire video was made with ONE prompt.\" Reveal the attached **Logo zoedit studio** with a crisp spring scale-in and subtle 2.5D glow.\n- **Scene 2 (5–11s | The Problem):** Fast, punchy visual contrast showing heavy video editors lagging vs. clean code-driven speed. Big readable text: \"Heavy editors slow you down. Prompts don't.\"\n- **Scene 3 (11–19s | Product Showcase):** Smoothly bring in the attached **Dashboard** screenshot inside a sleek, floating 2.5D tilted dark-UI showcase card with subtle zoom-in highlights. Callout badges animate around it: \"Remotion + AI Agents\", \"Free & Offline TTS\", \"Auto-Synced Captions\".\n- **Scene 4 (19–25s | Zero Cost & Open Source):** Clean animated metric cards and badges popping in with crisp spring physics: \"100% Open-Source (MIT)\", \"Local-First Privacy\", \"$0.00 Render Cost\".\n- **Scene 5 (25–30s | Outro & CTA):** Bring back the **Logo zoedit studio** centered with an energetic pulse, paired with bold CTA text: \"Build motion graphics at prompt speed\" and \"github.com/ZOF478/zoedit-studio\" + \"studio.zoedit.com\".\n\nStyle rules: High-contrast dark slate and electric blue/cyan palette, large mobile-safe typography (zero text overlapping the 2.5D dashboard screenshot), smooth spring transitions, and dynamic UI sound effects on every transition.",
